 "note": "EXPLORATORY. Only the selection step differs between scoring functions; the pose set and every RMSD are fixed and shared. Positive gain means the multiple-state receptor did better. Bootstrap unit is the homology component. Read each function's absolute success_top first: a function that picks poses worse than vina cannot settle the receptor question whatever its contrast says. gnina was trained on PDBbind-like complexes and our holo structures may be in that training set, so its absolute numbers are assumed optimistic; the paired contrast is unaffected because the leak enters both arms equally. top5_raw has no distinctness filter -- budget50 applies that."
